/-!
# E₈ two-slot data for the pair comparison: accessors and Boolean checks

Data (generated by `Notes/deligne/campaign/generators/e8_gen_pair.py`, emitted by `e8_emit_div.py`; a port of
the `E₇` layer) in per-family files `E8DivisorData*`:

* `tabR`, `parR`: the generation tree of `g* ⊗ g*` (61504 tables) from `δ₂₄₇⊗δ₂₄₇` by `S_x`, `A_x`: level 0
  (27000, `V(2θ)`), level 1 (30628, `Λ²`), level 2 (3876); depth `≤ 4`;
* `UR`, `UcR`: the complement tables `U_r` (192 × the `ψ`-dual of level 2; pairing denominator 96);
* `antiR`, `symR`: certificates for `120 (e_c⊗e_d - e_d⊗e_c)` (level ≤ 1) and
  `96 (e_c⊗e_d + e_d⊗e_c) - Σ_r ψ_r(c,d) U_r` (level 0); `psiR`: relations containing `{c, d}`;
* `colR`: bracket columns (checked against the rows `br = entry e8T`).
-/

